citation: |
  Aperio ImageScope region-crop export of a 590 tissue-microarray slide, fully
  owned by Toby C. Cornish / WSILabs and contributed expressly for the
  wsi-fixtures corpus under CC BY 4.0 (attribution required). Uncompressed
  tiled TIFF (only available under ImageScope's TIFF export); carries a
  mixed-codec associated-image set (uncompressed thumbnail + LZW label + JPEG
  overview). Regression fixture for opentile-go #28 (tiled uncompressed
  DecodedTile) and #29 (non-JPEG associated-image decode).
